  "title": "Hillsong Church - Welcome Home | Church",
  "text": "FIND A CHURCH HILLSONG JESUS COLLEGE MUSIC CONFERENCE STORE BLOG\nCHURCH\nABOUT\nAbout Hillsong\nLeadership\nAnnual Report\nJobs\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nLOCATIONS\nAsia Pacific\nEurope\nNorth America\nLatin America\nAfrica & Middle East\nMUSIC\nAll Music\nHillsong Worship\nUNITED\nHillsong Young & Free\nKids Music\nStore\nCONFERENCES\nCOLLEGE\nSTORIES\nCollected Blogs\nONLINE\nEN\nDE\nFR\nES\nCA\nPT\nPB\nUA\nRU\nSV\nID\nDA\nNO\nNL\nIT\nJA\nHU\nRO\nKO\nCLOSE \nFIND A HILLSONG CHURCH NEAR YOU\nUSE MY CURRENT LOCATION \nHillsong Church\nWelcome Home\n\nHillsong is a church that believes in Jesus, a church that loves God and people.\n\nOverwhelmed by the gift of salvation we have found in Jesus, we have a heart for authentic worship, are passionate about the local church, and are on mission to see God’s kingdom established across the earth.\n\nASIA PACIFIC EUROPE NORTH AMERICA LATIN AMERICA AFRICA & MIDDLE EAST ONLINE\n\n\n\n\nAUSTRALIA\nINDONESIA\nJAPAN\nPHILIPPINES\nSINGAPORE\nSOUTH KOREA\n\nMusic\n\nThe sound of our worship\n\nWorship\n\nSongs that exalt and glorify the Name of Jesus, build the Church, and fuel revival on the earth.\n\nHillsong Chapel\n\nSimple arrangements of God-glorifying songs for moments of intimate worship.\n\nHillsong Instrumentals\n\nBeautifully recorded and arranged songs for personal times of prayer and reflection.\n\nHillsong Kids\n\nEngaging children of this generation in worship.\n\nHillsong Conference\n\nHillsong Conference Europe 2026\n\nHillsong Conference Sydney 2027\n\nHillsong College\n\nFind your community. Prepare for purpose.\n\nStrategically placed within the life of our local church in Sydney, Hillsong College allows you to apply the skills you will learn in a practical ministry setting so that you can lead and impact in your world.\n\nHILLSONG COLLEGE\n\nUnity and Belonging\n\nHillsong Church is a multi-generational church made up of people from richly diverse cultural and ethnic backgrounds—committed to unity and belonging centered on Christ. We are intentional about building a church where people of all ages and backgrounds participate fully in the body of Christ—in line with how Jesus prayed (Jn 17:22-23), with what the early church modeled (Acts 2, Gal 3:28) and with what heaven will be like (Rev 7:9). This commitment is part of our vision to be a healthy church changing lives through Christ. As part of our Welcome Home Value, we are invitational—creating warm environments where every one is valued.\n\nHillsong Collected\n\nOur Blog\n\nStories, thoughts and articles about what\nJesus is doing in our world, and how we outwork that\nthrough our local churches.\n\nSTART READING\nAbout\nHillsong Church\nLeadership\nWhat we believe\nGovernance\nJobs\nMedia\nAfrica\nKenya\nNigeria\nSouth Africa\nAsia Pacific\nAustralia\nIndonesia\nJapan\nSingapore\nSouth Korea\nPhilippines\nEurope\nAustria\nBelgium\nDenmark\nFrance\nGermany\nItaly\nNetherlands\nPortugal\nRomania\nSpain\nSweden\nSwitzerland\nUkraine\nUnited Kingdom\nLatin America\nArgentina\nBrazil\nMexico\nUruguay\nMiddle East\nIsrael\nNorth America\nCanada\nUSA\nEvents\nHillsong Conference\nTours\nStore\nAll\nBooks\nMusic\nTeaching\nMusic\nMusic\nWorship\nUnited\nYoung & Free\nKids\nA Healthy Church Changing Lives Through Christ\nFIND A CHURCH\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYoutube\n© 2026 Hillsong. All Rights Reserved.\nCookie Settings\nCOOKIES\nHillsong International Ltd atf Hillsong International, \"Hillsong\", uses cookies on this website and its associated Hillsong websites. By accepting the use of cookies on Hillsong websites, you permit us to collect and use data from your activity on the devices you use in accordance with Hillsong's Cookie Policy.\nReject All\nAccept All Cookies\nSettings",
